  "display_title": "Tempting My Salvation",
  "description": "Lavielle's life turned upside down when she lost her entire family. With nowhere to go, when a kind marquess offered to take her in, she was more than grateful...until she learned it came at a price. Forced to endure nightly torment, Lavielle begs for someone-anyone-to save her. Her prayers are answered when Lucien appears, claiming to be the Marquess's son... But is he truly who he says he is? Can he really be trusted? And, most of all, can Lavielle finally tempt her salvation?\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
